values ('c9d0e1f2-3a4b-4d03-8a23-3e4f5a6b7c33', 'sustainable-design', 'Sustainable Design', 'Sustainable Design is an advanced architecture course on climate-responsive, low-carbon, healthy, resilient, and equitable building design. Students learn to translate sustainability values into measurable design goals, technical strategies, life-cycle decisions, and post-occupancy evidence. The course connects studio judgment with building science, environmental systems, materials, site ecology, certification frameworks, and climate adaptation.');

